================================================================================
deploy/ — Unitree Robotics, Apache License 2.0
================================================================================

The G1 controller under deploy/ is derived from the deploy/ tree of

    https://github.com/unitreerobotics/unitree_rl_mjlab

which is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0, and whose own LICENCE
file carries "Copyright 2024 The Isaac Lab Project Developers". Individual
source files retain their "Copyright (c) 2025, Unitree Robotics Co., Ltd."
headers, and no copyright line has been added to files that were only
modified. One header was removed rather than kept: deploy/include/FSM/StatePub.h
is new here — it publishes over LCM, which upstream has none of — and carried
that header only as a copy-paste artifact from a sibling file. Leaving it would
have claimed Unitree's authorship of our code.

As required by Apache-2.0 section 4(b), the following changes were made:

  ADDED (new files, no Unitree copyright claimed on them)
    include/FSM/StatePub.h      publishes proprioceptive state over LCM
    include/FSM/CmdInputPub.h   publishes the joystick twist, scaled to the
                                policy's command ranges
    include/rt_dashboard.h      live loop-timing dashboard
    include/rt_telemetry.h      control- and policy-loop deadline statistics
    include/unitree_joystick_dsl.hpp
                                declarative gamepad chords ("RT + A.on_pressed")
                                so FSM transitions are configuration, not code
    robots/g1/rt_bench.cpp      scheduler-latency benchmark

  MODIFIED
    include/FSM/State_RLBase.h  policy runs on its own thread with deadline
                                telemetry; publishes state and the scaled
                                joystick twist over LCM
    include/isaaclab/assets/articulation/articulation.h
                                added use_vel_cmd_override / vel_cmd_override,
                                an integration point for an external twist
                                source
    include/isaaclab/envs/mdp/observations/observations.h
                                velocity_commands honours that override
    robots/g1/main.cpp          real-time defaults for the dashboard and the
                                FSM thread priority
    robots/g1/CMakeLists.txt    ONNX Runtime fetched rather than vendored; LCM
                                types generated at build time
    robots/g1/config/config.yaml
                                four states (Passive, FixStand, RlStand,
                                Velocity) driving the two policies shipped here
    robots/g1/config/policy/velocity/v0/params/deploy_mjlab.yaml
                                regenerated at full precision from the ONNX
                                metadata; the hand-rounded values it replaced
                                were up to 3% off on damping

  REMOVED
                                robot targets other than the 29-DoF G1; the
                                State_Mimic reference-motion state and the cnpy
                                dependency it needed

Upstream has no NOTICE file, so there is no upstream notice content to
propagate under section 4(d).

