================================================================================
The policies
================================================================================

The two ONNX policies under deploy/robots/g1/config/policy/ were trained in
https://github.com/psrobotics/smp, which reproduces SMP (Mu et al. 2025,
arXiv:2512.03028) on top of mjlab (https://github.com/mujocolab/mjlab). Nothing
from that repository is vendored here — only the exported graphs. See
UPSTREAM for the run that produced each.

ONNX Runtime (MIT, Copyright (c) Microsoft Corporation) is fetched at build
time by scripts/fetch_onnxruntime.sh, not committed.
